{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"FLEET LESSON (basilisk, 2026-08-13): run tests/integration EXPLICITLY before pushing store/compaction/git-seam changes — CI's main pytest invocation excludes that tier, and it has now held the ONLY real failure twice this session (1702's s3_doctor signature, basilisk's compact-all selection regression). Add 'python -m pytest tests/integration' to the pre-push gate list in implementer briefs for anything touching _store/, compact*, or gitutil."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786607706146723001,"uuid":"a1a35e90-9447-4d94-8772-5526457bc165"}